# Never copy files that are deliberately kept out of the published repo.
# The Dockerfile copies sts2/ wholesale, so without these a locally built
# image carries the maintainer's private modules and working data, and they
# stay importable inside the container. Keep this list in step with the
# "Private modules" section of .gitignore.
sts2/risk.py
sts2/diagnosis.py
sts2/data/pheromones.json
sts2/data/hypotheses.json
sts2/data/.fetcher_keys.json
# Game text built from the user's own install — not ours to redistribute.
sts2/locales/content/
